# Exclude the Go workspace files from the Docker build context.
#
# `go build` inside the image would otherwise run in workspace mode, which ignores the committed
# module `vendor/` directory and tries to resolve modules over the network. The build image has no
# git and cannot reach the private `gitlab.alibaba-inc.com/eml/kubequeue-api` replacement, so the
# build must run in module mode and use vendor/. Dropping go.work here makes that happen.
go.work
go.work.sum
